e_garter_belt_and_stockings.JPG/960px-White_garter_belt_and_stockings.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/White_garter_belt_and_stockings.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"White garter belt and stockings","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","creator":"Marcushsu","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:White_garter_belt_and_stockings.JPG","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Garter_belt_and_stockings.jpg/960px-Garter_belt_and_stockings.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/Garter_belt_and_stockings.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Garter belt and stockings","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Genusfotografen (Tommas Gunnarsson) / Wikimedia","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Garter_belt_and_stockings.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Garter_belt_with_lace.jpg/960px-Garter_belt_with_lace.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/Garter_belt_with_lace.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Garter belt with lace","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Genusfotografen (Tommas Gunnarsson) / Wikimedia","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Garter_belt_with_lace.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Red_garter_belt_with_stockings.jpg/960px-Red_garter_belt_with_stockings.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/Red_garter_belt_with_stockings.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Red garter belt with stockings","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Genusfotografen (Tommas Gunnarsson) / Wikimedia","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Red_garter_belt_with_stockings.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/White_lace_garter_belt.jpg/960px-White_lace_garter_belt.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/White_lace_garter_belt.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"White lace garter belt","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Another Energy","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:White_lace_garter_belt.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Lingerie_garter_belt.jpg/960px-Lingerie_garter_belt.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/Lingerie_garter_belt.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Lingerie garter belt","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","creator":"Tender Rosebud","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lingerie_garter_belt.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Garter_belt_otokonoko_sketch_20160416.jpg/960px-Garter_belt_otokonoko_sketch_20160416.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/Garter_belt_otokonoko_sketch_20160416.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Garter belt otokonoko sketch 20160416","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"KOKUYO","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Garter_belt_otokonoko_sketch_20160416.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://api.openverse.org/v1/images/9f2e4614-d271-48e2-9a4a-07dd73c94840/thumb/","full":"https://live.staticflickr.com/8090/8405651005_1a11b8c355_b.jpg","title":"Garter belt","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","creator":"Lee Bennett","page":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/55455788@N00/8405651005","source":"Flickr"}],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Prevention of Breast Implant Displacement Using the Acellular Dermal Matrix Garter Belt.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34845513/","source":"Aesthetic plastic surgery","year":2022,"cites":3,"kind":null},{"title":"Invited Discussion on: Prevention of Breast Implant Displacement Using the Acellular Dermal Matrix Garter Belt.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34850251/","source":"Aesthetic plastic surgery","year":2022,"cites":0,"kind":null},{"title":"Natural clamping system, useful for fixing hosiery without using mechanical support and for therapeutic purposes, comprises glucose, mineral water, cornstarch, honey and potato starch","url":"https://europepmc.org/article/PAT/FR2881433","source":null,"year":2006,"cites":0,"kind":null},{"title":"CATHETER HOLDER","url":"https://europepmc.org/article/PAT/US2006293631","source":null,"year":2006,"cites":0,"kind":null}],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Garter - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garter_belt"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Style & presentation","chain":["Belt sits at the waist with clips on stockings","Stockings stay up without a thigh band","Smooth leg line and vintage silhouette"],"effect":"direct","text":"Worn at the waist, the belt keeps stockings taut so the leg line stays smooth, a look people choose for vintage, formal or costume outfits."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["A garter belt, called a suspender belt in the UK, is a wider elasticated strip, usually at least two to three inches wide, with elastic slings on each side ending in metal clips that grip stockings [1]. It evolved from the earlier garter, a band with a hook tied just below the knee [1].","For appearance it gives a smooth stocking line with no thigh band, and is part of vintage-style and formal outfits. Suspenders became a popular alternative to girdles in the 1940s-60s until pantyhose arrived in the early 1960s [1]. Medical use also exists: suspenders hold support hosiery for varicose veins or poor circulation [1]."],"infobox":[["Type","Hosiery suspender garment"],["Predecessor","Knee garter"],["Width","Typically 2-3 inches [1]"],["Fasteners","Metal clips on elastic slings"],["UK name","Suspender belt"]],"sections":[{"h":"Design","paras":["The garter is a narrow band that holds up a stocking; the suspender belt is a separate garment with elastic slings and metal clips and adjustable elastic for fit [1]. It sits at or just below the waist so the pull of the stockings does not drag it down [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"History","paras":["Elizabethan men wore bright garters with hose, and eighteenth-century garters were often embroidered with names or phrases [1]. Before elastic, they used buckles or spiral springs [1]. Suspenders became widely available in the mid-1920s, were issued to British Women's Auxiliary Air Force members in World War II, and were a girdle alternative in the 1940s-60s [1]. Sales rose after the 1988 film Bull Durham, which retailers linked to a black lace garter [1]. Wedding garter traditions continue in the West [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. The term also appears in unrelated surgical literature, such as an acellular dermal matrix 'garter belt' technique for breast implant pockets, which is a different procedure [2]."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[{"year":"1920s","event":"Suspenders widely available [1]"},{"year":"1940s-1960s","event":"Popular girdle alternative [1]"},{"year":"1988","event":"Sales rise after Bull Durham [1]"}],"refs":[{"title":"Garter","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garter_belt","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Prevention of Breast Implant Displacement Using the Acellular Dermal Matrix Garter Belt","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34845513/","source":"Aesthetic plastic surgery","year":2022,"type":"study"}],"studies":[{"title":"Prevention of Breast Implant Displacement Using the Acellular Dermal Matrix Garter Belt","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34845513/","source":"Aesthetic plastic surgery","year":2022,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[]}